      "content": "That makes sense. To wrap this up for the client, could you summarize the practical implications for vineyard management? Like, if we see these symptoms (iron chlorosis) in a block with a pH heading toward 7.0, what are the standard mitigation strategies to prevent that sequestration from becoming permanent? I'll use your summary as the 'Recommendations' section of the report.",
